# Eikonal variant: eikonalSolver + eikonalSolver1D.
#
# The eikonal myocardium domain overrides the case time controls
# (eikonalMyocardiumDomain::applyModelTimeControls) and solves a single
# steady boundary-value problem, so the run writes exactly one time
# directory, 1/, whatever endTime says. Sample that.
#
# file                                  time   col  expected      tolerance
injectionProbe/0/activationTime         1      2    0.0058399     1e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.025  5    0.003966149   2e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.035  3   -0.006853826   2e-4
eikonalECG.dat                          0.04   7    0.006916027   2e-4
